From: RDNA3-Hackintosh
Subject: [PATCH] radv: a dynamic primitive topology may change class

The Metal plugin builds every graphics pipeline with a dynamic primitive
topology and draws points, lines and triangles with the same pipeline,
as Metal allows. RADV reports dynamicPrimitiveTopologyUnrestricted =
false and compiles the pipeline for the topology class it was created
with, so the plugin skipped every point and line draw (card runs 54-56:
"G14 draw: point/line primitives ... NOT drawn" in WindowServer).

RADV already compiles for an unknown topology with graphics pipeline
libraries (V_008958_DI_PT_NONE: NGG lowered for three vertices, the
hardware ignores the extra ones for points and lines, NGG culling is
turned off for them at draw time). Use that key whenever the topology is
dynamic and report the feature.
---
diff --git a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_physical_device.c b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_physical_device.c
index 5edb325..d4baeb5 100644
--- a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_physical_device.c
@@ -2260,7 +2260,7 @@ radv_get_physical_device_properties(struct radv_physical_device *pdev)
       .prefersCompactPrimitiveOutput = false,
 
       /* VK_EXT_extended_dynamic_state3 */
-      .dynamicPrimitiveTopologyUnrestricted = false,
+      .dynamicPrimitiveTopologyUnrestricted = true,
 
       /* VK_EXT_descriptor_buffer */
       .combinedImageSamplerDescriptorSingleArray = true,
diff --git a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_pipeline_graphics.c b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_pipeline_graphics.c
index b742d71..e0cc0b2 100644
--- a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_pipeline_graphics.c
+++ b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_pipeline_graphics.c
@@ -1721,6 +1721,12 @@ radv_generate_graphics_state_key(const struct radv_compiler_info *compiler_info,
 
    if (state->ia) {
       key.ia.topology = radv_translate_prim(state->ia->primitive_topology);
+      /* A dynamic topology may change class at draw time (dynamicPrimitiveTopologyUnrestricted): compile for an
+       * unknown topology, as with graphics pipeline libraries (NGG for up to 3 vertices, culling off for
+       * points and lines at draw time).
+       */
+      if (BITSET_TEST(state->dynamic, MESA_VK_DYNAMIC_IA_PRIMITIVE_TOPOLOGY))
+         key.ia.topology = V_008958_DI_PT_NONE;
    }
 
    key.rs.polygon_mode_unknown = !state->rs || BITSET_TEST(state->dynamic, MESA_VK_DYNAMIC_RS_POLYGON_MODE);
